<title>BELGIUM: Mercedes 1996 truck sales, revenue rose.</title>
<headline>Mercedes 1996 truck sales, revenue rose.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Global truck unit sales	    348,200 vs 320,100 units</p>
<p>    Global truck revenue		 31,500  vs 31,600</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car maker is Mercedes-Benz AG, a unit of Daimler-Benz AG. The figures were released at a motor show by Kurt Lauk, head of Mercedes truck division.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
